---
layout: page.njk
---

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero-inner">

    <div class="eyebrow">A Personal Space for Thoughts</div>

    <h1>
      Some feelings are not meant to be explained.
      <br>
      <em>They are meant to be written.</em>
    </h1>

    <p class="guj">
      કેટલીક વાતો કહેવા માટે નથી હોતી... લખવા માટે હોય છે.
    </p>

    <div class="actions">
      <a class="btn primary" href="#blogs">Read My Blogs</a>
      <a class="btn" href="#shayari">Explore Shayari</a>
      <a class="btn" href="#lessons">Life Lessons</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>


<section>
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="eyebrow">A Thought From Me</div>

    <div class="thought">

      <div class="quote guj">
        જીવન હંમેશા આપણને એ નથી આપતું જેની આપણે ઈચ્છા કરીએ છીએ...<br>
        ક્યારેક એ આપણને એ આપે છે, જે આપણને સમજવા માટે જરૂરી હોય છે.
      </div>

      <div class="translation">
        Life doesn't always give us what we wish for.
        Sometimes, it gives us what we need to understand.
      </div>

      <div class="signature">
        — Sarang
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>


<section>
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="eyebrow">Three Worlds of Writing</div>

    <h2>Words that come from within.</h2>

    <div class="grid">

      <a class="card" href="#blogs">
        <div class="num">01 / BLOGS</div>
        <h3>Stories & Thoughts</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          Experiences, observations and thoughts about life,
          people and relationships.
        </p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="#shayari">
        <div class="num">02 / SHAYARI</div>
        <h3>Words Between Silence</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          Hindi and Gujarati shayari about love,
          pain, memories and life.
        </p>
      </a>

      <a class="card" href="#lessons">
        <div class="num">03 / LIFE LESSONS</div>
        <h3>Lessons From Life</h3>
        <p class="muted">
          English reflections on failure, resilience,
          relationships and time.
        </p>
      </a>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>


<section id="shayari">
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="eyebrow">Featured Shayari</div>

    <h2>Sometimes poetry says what we cannot.</h2>

    <div class="feature">

      <div class="shayari">

        <small>Hindi</small>

        कुछ लोग दूर होकर भी<br>
        दिल के सबसे करीब रहते हैं,<br>
        और कुछ पास होकर भी<br>
        सिर्फ़ यादों में रहते हैं।

      </div>

      <div class="shayari guj">

        <small>ગુજરાતી</small>

        કેટલાક લોકો દૂર રહીને પણ<br>
        હૃદયની સૌથી નજીક રહે છે,<br>
        અને કેટલાક નજીક રહીને પણ<br>
        ફક્ત યાદોમાં જ રહે છે.

      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>


<section id="blogs">
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="eyebrow">Latest From My Journal</div>

    <h2>Recent words.</h2>

    <div class="posts">

      {% for post in collections.posts %}

        <article class="blog">

          <div class="eyebrow">
            {{ post.data.type }} / {{ post.data.category }}
          </div>

          {% if post.data.image %}
            <img
              src="{{ post.data.image }}"
              alt="{{ post.data.title }}"
            >
          {% endif %}

          <h3>
            {{ post.data.title }}
          </h3>

          {% if post.data.excerpt %}
            <p class="muted">
              {{ post.data.excerpt }}
            </p>
          {% endif %}

          <a class="btn" href="{{ post.url }}">
            Read Story
          </a>

        </article>

      {% endfor %}

    </div>

  </div>
</section>


<section id="lessons">
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="eyebrow">Life Lesson</div>

    <div class="lesson">
      “Not everyone who walks away from you is your loss.
      Sometimes their absence is the space your life needed
      to breathe again.”
    </div>

  </div>
</section>


<section id="about">
  <div class="wrap about">

    <div>

      <div class="eyebrow">About Me</div>

      <h2>
        I simply write the things
        I sometimes cannot say.
      </h2>

    </div>

    <div class="box">

      <p>
        Welcome to <strong>Words From Within</strong>.
      </p>

      <p>
        This is my personal corner of the internet —
        a place for thoughts, stories, shayari and lessons
        collected from life.
      </p>

      <p>
        I believe some emotions become clearer
        when we write them down.
      </p>

      <p>
        — Sarang
      </p>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>